# What the image installs. requirements.txt is this, resolved and locked
# with hashes:
#
#   nix develop -c uv pip compile requirements.in --generate-hashes \
#     --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o requirements.txt
#
# The versions are those of the Nix dev shell (flake.lock), which the tests
# run against, and of images/policy-operator.
